title: Denial Intelligence › Appeal analysis report › Copy, PDF and print
route: /denials/D-3297/report
intro: Three ways to take the report with you. In the hosted preview the PDF and Print are switched off, because the host page blocks downloads and printing; copying still works.
dir: TD
also: Demo only: the PDF is made in the browser. In production the report would also be saved to the case.
---
start s1 "The report is on screen"

click c1 "Click 'Copy report'"
process p1 "The whole report becomes plain text\nCapital headings, numbered findings and recommendations"
decision d1 "Does the browser allow copying?"
process p2 "Fallback: a hidden text box and the copy command"
decision d2 "Did the fallback work?"
toast t1 "Button reads 'Copied' for 2 seconds"
toast t2 "'Select the text and press Ctrl or Cmd C'"
end e1 "Report text is in the clipboard"
endx e2 "Nothing was copied"

click c2 "Click 'Download PDF'"
decision d3 "Is this the hosted preview?"
toast t3 "'Download PDF is off in this preview'\n'Open the single-file version of the demo to use it.'"
process p3 "Button shows a spinner\nThe PDF library loads now, not before"
process p4 "US Letter, 0.75 inch margins, built-in fonts\nTitle band, facts, every section, numbered recommendations, options table\nHeading never alone at the bottom of a page"
process p5 "Running header on each page after the first\nFooter: 'Draft by FLO's agents. A clinician reviews and signs before anything is sent.' and 'Page x of y'"
doc dc1 "Psyflo-appeal-analysis-D-3297.pdf\nTitle, subject and author 'Psyflo' are set"
decision d4 "Did it work?"
toast t4 "'PDF downloaded'\n'Psyflo-appeal-analysis-D-3297.pdf has the whole report.'"
toast t5 "'Could not make the PDF'\n'Copy the report instead and paste it into a document.'"
end e3 "PDF is in the downloads folder"
endx e4 "No file"

click c3 "Click 'Print'"
decision d5 "Is this the hosted preview?"
toast t6 "'Print is off in this preview'\n'Open the single-file version of the demo to use it.'"
process p6 "The browser print dialog opens"
process p7 "Print layout: sidebar, top bar and buttons hidden\n'What we would do' starts a new page\nA heading stays with its text; findings and recommendations are not split"
doc dc2 "Paper or PDF copy of the report"
end e5 "Report is on paper"
endx e6 "Nothing printed"

click c4 "Click 'Back to the denial'"
goto g1 "Continues in: Denial Intelligence › A denial opened"
click c5 "Click 'Regenerate'"
goto g2 "Continues in: Denial Intelligence › Appeal analysis report › Open and generate"

s1 --> c1 & c2 & c3 & c4 & c5
c1 --> p1 --> d1
d1 -->|Yes| t1 --> e1
d1 -->|No| p2 --> d2
d2 -->|Yes| t1
d2 -->|No| t2 --> e2
c2 --> d3
d3 -->|Yes| t3 --> e4
d3 -->|No| p3 --> p4 --> p5 --> d4
d4 -->|Yes| dc1 --> t4 --> e3
d4 -->|No| t5 --> e4
c3 --> d5
d5 -->|Yes| t6 --> e6
d5 -->|No| p6 --> p7 --> dc2 --> e5
c4 --> g1
c5 --> g2
